				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>血が　たぎりますな！
今日も　お相手　願いますぞ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
